/Title (The study provides a basis for further discussion on how parking garages can be designed with regard to vehicle development and user needs. However, the results should be interpreted with some caution as the study is based on a limited number of case studies, interviews and user tests and therefore mainly provides exploratory indications rather than generally valid conclusions.)
