/Title (The purpose of the study was to investigate how existing parking garages relate to today's changed vehicle dimensions and how the parking design can be developed to improve usability and function. The study was based on literature studies, vehicle data, site studies, interviews, user tests and modelling of larger parking dimensions in existing parking garages.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3463 0 R
/Prev 3693 0 R
/Next 3932 0 R
>>
endobj
3853 0 obj
<<
/Title (The modelling experiments indicate that the possibilities of introducing larger parking spaces can improve usability by creating more space for entry and exit. At the same time, the results indicate that the possibilities of introducing larger parking spaces in existing parking garages are often limited by garage design, column placements and available manoeuvring space. In the garages studied, larger parking spaces also resulted in a reduced parking capacity.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3463 0 R
/Prev 3932 0 R
/Next 3694 0 R
>>
endobj
